<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>test<sp/>receives<sp/>and<sp/>echo-backs<sp/>data<sp/>through<sp/>the<sp/>UART<sp/>A<sp/>port.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
